#: luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-sonic.js:22
msgid "Enable Fullcone NAT"
msgstr "启用全锥形 NAT"

#: luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-sonic.js:17
msgid ""
"Enable IPv4 fullcone NAT for selected firewall zones. IPv4 masquerading must "
"also be enabled in the zone settings."
msgstr ""
"为选定的防火墙区域启用 IPv4 全锥形 NAT。还需要在区域设置中启用 IPv4 地址伪"
"装。"

#: luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-sonic.js:31
msgid "Enable for this zone"
msgstr "为此区域启用"

#: luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-sonic.js:16
msgid ""
"Enable fullcone NAT for selected firewall zones. IPv4 or IPv6 masquerading "
"must also be enabled in the zone settings."
msgstr ""
"为选定的防火墙区域启用全锥形 NAT。还需要在区域设置中启用 IPv4 或 IPv6 地址伪"
"装。"

