#: luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-sonic.js:36
msgid ""
"Leave empty to enable TCP, UDP, UDP-Lite and SCTP. Other protocols use "
"ordinary masquerading."
msgstr "留空时启用 TCP、UDP、UDP-Lite 和 SCTP。其他协议使用普通地址伪装。"

